Meta:
	Version	1
	
	Lang	ja
	Title	泡沫夢幻
	Desc	ゲージ上昇UP <#c:00f>(240%)
	Desc	MISS判定20回で強制終了
	
	Lang	en
	Title	Ephemeral
	Desc	Increments the gauge increase rate to
	Desc	<#c:00f>240%<#r>.
	Desc	<#c:70f>Sidden Death occurs<#r> when MISS counts
	Desc	20 times.
	
	Attr	DHard
	Indicator	IDanger	INBoost
	CountDef	20

OnStart:
	Boost	IDanger	Add	0
	
OnJudge:
	If	Answer	=	M
		Counter	-1
		Boost	IDanger	Add	0.0
	ClearIf
	
	If	Answer	!=	M
		Boost	INBoost	Mul	2.4
	ClearIf
	
	If	Counter	<=	0
		Kill
	ClearIf
	